Prisma schema lives in the db package (`schema.prisma`). After editing it, run `{{pm}} db:push` to sync and `{{pm}} db:generate` to regenerate the client. Inspect data with `{{pm}} db:studio`.

The client is generated into `generated/prisma`, which is not committed. `{{pm}} db:generate` runs before `dev` and `build` ({{#if (isMono)}}Turborepo `dependsOn` on `^db:generate`{{else}}the `predev` and `prebuild` scripts{{/if}}) and needs `DATABASE_URL` in `.env`. Run it by hand after a schema edit while `dev` is running.

`{{pm}} db:migrate` (`prisma migrate dev`) asks for a migration name, so run it from a terminal.
